**1. 实体遍历（拿坐标）**
UE4/UE5 常用链：`UWorld + [UWorldToGameInstance]` → `GameInstance + LocalPlayers` → `PlayerController` → `AcknowledgedPawn` → `RootComponent` → `RelativeLocation`。GNames/GObjects 走 `GObjects` 数组 + `ChunkSize` 分块读，`FName` 走 `GNames + (idx/0x4000)*8` 取 `FNameEntry`。

**2. 世界到屏幕（W2S）**
从 `PlayerController` 取 `PlayerCameraManager`，再取 `CameraCache`（`FMinimalViewInfo`）里的 `POV.Location` / `Rotation` / `FOV`，配合 `ViewMatrix`（`POV` 后偏移或直接读 `CameraCache.POV` 的手工构建矩阵）。公式：

```cpp
bool W2S(const Vec3& world, const float m[16], int w, int h, Vec2& out) {
    float x = world.x*m[0] + world.y*m[1] + world.z*m[2] + m[3];
    float y = world.x*m[4] + world.y*m[5] + world.z*m[6] + m[7];
    float z = world.x*m[8] + world.y*m[9] + world.z*m[10] + m[11];
    float w_ = world.x*m[12] + world.y*m[13] + world.z*m[14] + m[15];
    if (w_ < 0.001f) return false;
    out.x = (w / 2) * (1 + x / w_);
    out.y = (h / 2) * (1 - y / w_);
    return true;
}
```

